OL,3,GNEWSATheft-accused trio 'made friends'
OL,4,Awith King's lambs
OL,5,
OL,6,FSharkey told a jury she hoped their
OL,7,Factions would open His Majesty's eyes
OL,8,Fto the "reality of sheep farming" by
OL,9,Fraising their concerns about animal
OL,10,Fwelfare and environmental harm.
